

To compile and link the 32-bit floating point example do this : 


$ nvcc -ccbin g++ -I../include -m64 -gencode arch=compute_30,code=sm_30 -c -o vaddf.o vaddf.cu 
$ nvcc -ccbin g++ -m64 -gencode arch=compute_30,code=sm_30 -o vaddf vaddf.o -lgomp

The 64-bit FP64 code with IEEE754-2008 compliance ( maybe ) : 

$ nvcc -ccbin g++ -I../include -m64 -gencode arch=compute_30,code=sm_30 --ftz=false --prec-div=true --prec-sqrt=true -fmad=false -c -o vaddf.o vaddf.cu 
$ nvcc -ccbin g++ -m64 -gencode arch=compute_30,code=sm_30 --ftz=false --prec-div=true --prec-sqrt=true -fmad=false -o vaddf vaddf.o -lgomp
$ 



d$ 
